{"id":"u-7f63c9da-7e02-45c2-a48c-3e847fc6a1be","src":"community","title":"Bronze Era Physique - High Frequency","author":"Savageresolve","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/aZPGQB-boostcampreadybronzeera","desc":"This program is a high-frequency Bronze Era-inspired torso/limbs split built to develop:\n\ndense athletic muscle,\nreal-world strength,\ngrip and tendon durability,\nconditioning,\nand mobility.\n\nInstead of chasing pure aesthetics or maximal fatigue, it focuses on frequent high-quality training with:\n\ncompound lifts,\ncarries,\nbodyweight strength,\nexplosive work,\nunilateral training,\nand athletic conditioning.\n\nYou train most movement patterns multiple times per week while staying shy of failure so recovery stays sustainable. The result is a physique closer to old-school strongmen and physical culturists:\n\nthick back and shoulders,\npowerful legs and hips,\nstrong forearms and neck,\nsolid posture,\nand usable athleticism.\n\nThe goal is not just to look muscular — it’s to look and move like someone physically capable.\n\nI work out in my home gym and some of the exercise selections are geared to that end.","level":["Intermediate"],"goals":["Athletics","Strength","Muscle"],"equipment":["Garage Gym"],"minutes":70,"joins":5,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-08-11T18:05:48.552Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["TORSO A","LIMBS A","TORSO B","LIMBS B","TORSO C","Day 6"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Pull-Up (Weighted)","sets":[{"r":5,"rpe":8,"x":9}]},{"n":"Overhead Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":5,"x":5}]},{"n":"Chest Supported Row (Machine)","sets":[{"r":8,"x":4}]},{"n":"Dip (Weighted)","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":8,"rpe":8,"x":7}]},{"n":"Neck Flexion","sets":[{"lo":15,"hi":20,"x":2}]},{"n":"Dead Hang","sets":[{"sec":30,"x":3}]},{"n":"Hammer Curl (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":12,"x":3}]},{"n":"Band Pull Apart","sets":[{"r":100}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Hack Squat -Smith","sets":[{"r":5,"rpe":8,"x":9}]},{"n":"Romanian Deadlift (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":8